Button Visibility		
Button	Permission Set	Work Item Condition
Submit for Approval	Owner permission set based on Standard Class	None — visibility uses owner + status/stage
Withdraw	Owner permission set based on Standard Class	None — visibility uses owner + status/stage
Reassign Approver	Owner permission set based on Standard Class	None — visibility uses owner + status/stage
Recall	Owner permission set based on Standard Class	None — visibility uses owner + status/stage
Acknowledge	ASP_ACKNOWLEDGER	Assigned work item with label = Acknowledgement
Approve	Approver permission set based on Standard Class	Assigned work item with label = Approval
Send Back	ASP_ACKNOWLEDGER OR Approver permission set based on Standard Class	User must qualify for Acknowledge or Approve
